messages "Drude**Subj: bugs in gameCc: sandtigerDate: Jul 13   Hiya,It seems we're playing in different timezones so we don't meet eachotherin the MUD very often but I've noticed your conversations with eg. Cendoron the mud-channel and am very curious what it is precisely that you'retalking about concerning the bugs that you're encountering.This MUD more or less seems a mess without any highlevel arches or wizzeson. Like Cendor who's willing enough to help and also seems to have theskills to program but doesn't have the access to change the code.So what are the bugs you've encountered? ... and which are killing you...The ones I've found so far is that my 'consider' skill has gone from'outstanding' to '0' whatever that may mean ... I can still use it at least.A nasty one I've found out about is that when I'm necro and I tank for myhorde (or the mobile attacks me first) that in the end it just won't dieand of course my horde won't follow either since it is so bloodthursty.End of the tale is that I've got to start a new horde all over again .. themonster just won't take any damage anymore even when I'm asking friendlymages to blast it.Well would be nice hearing from you. Cheers,   Drude**"
